  m_text: "Health Potion \u2014 Instantly restores a portion of your health\n\nShield
    \u2014 Grants temporary invincibility, blocking all incoming damage\n\nXP Potion
    \u2014 Gives you extra experience points\n\nTime Hiccup \u2014 Slows all enemies
    to a crawl for a short duration\n\nGravity Flip \u2014 Causes all enemies to
    flee away from you temporarily\n\nXP Vacuum \u2014 Pulls all XP orbs on the map
    toward you\n\nParanoia \u2014 Covers the side of the screen in darkness"
