  m_text: "Sniper \u2014 Fires a fast piercing bullet that travels through every
    enemy in its path\nBoomerang \u2014 Throws a boomerang toward your cursor that
    returns to you, dealing damage both ways\nBomb \u2014 Lobs an explosive toward
    your cursor that detonates after a short fuse, dealing area damage\nScatter \u2014
    Fires a wide cone of bullets in front of you, shredding anything nearby\nBlink
    \u2014 Teleports you instantly to your cursor position"
